DiscoBAX comparator
------------------
screenprior.comparators implements routines from the equations and algorithms in Lyle, Mehrjou,
Notin, Jesson, Bauer, Gal and Schwab, "DiscoBAX: Discovery of optimal intervention sets in genomic
experiment design", ICML 2023. screenprior.discobax connects them to the package's shared
bagged-ridge harness. It does not use DiscoBAX's neural surrogate or upstream source code.

The implementation records its mathematical choices in the module documentation. Configuration
values not stated in the paper are labelled DISCOBAX_CONFIG and attributed to the released run
configuration. Tests use hand-computed arithmetic from the equations.

The upstream repository is https://github.com/amehrjou/DiscoBAX. Its licence discrepancy, GPL-3.0
in the root licence and Apache-2.0 in source headers, is recorded in the component documentation.
Upstream source code is not included in this package.

